{"unit_id":"xiciyang__dsh-visual-memory#card-1","repo":"xiciyang/dsh-visual-memory","commit":"9c45f204a1feee402a124eb8b55965d678fdf46c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Visual Memory 是面向 DSH agent 的视觉记忆插件，通过 tools、attachments 和 webServer 接入宿主。它把图像原样保存并建立可检索索引，可按文字、标签、哈希和轮次找回历史图像，也能记录关注区域、拼接多张观察图、读取像素颜色并查看记忆状态。适合需要回看截图、比较界面变化或读取精确颜色的场景。运行需要 DSH 0.2.x、Node.js 22 及本机 Python 3 和 Pillow；不需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:583-623","lib/index.mjs:624-743","lib/index.mjs:744-811","lib/index.mjs:812-915","lib/index.mjs:916-1095","cordis.patch.yml:3-12"]}
{"unit_id":"xiciyang__dsh-visual-memory#card-2","repo":"xiciyang/dsh-visual-memory","commit":"9c45f204a1feee402a124eb8b55965d678fdf46c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Visual Memory gives DSH agents searchable image memory. It stores original images and retrieves them by text, tags, hashes, or turn. Agents can annotate regions, compare labeled views, and read pixel colors. Requires DSH 0.2.x, Node.js 22, Python 3, and Pillow; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:583-623","lib/index.mjs:624-743","lib/index.mjs:744-811","lib/index.mjs:812-915","lib/index.mjs:916-1095","cordis.patch.yml:3-12"]}
